    "Roadster desktop and classic mobile entries retain pre-existing damage; their ending damage did not increase. Tesla desktop/mobile entries and ending damage are zero.",
    "One initial unarmed capture and exploratory coasting attempts were excluded. No failed or exploratory case is presented as a collision-free success.",
    "No browser console errors were reported after the native runs."
